(6092989, 897514, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I don''t think it quite works. To be nit-picky, it''s really not a rectangle, it''s more of a parallelogram (you don''t have 90 degree angles). The wild processing is close, but the red blotches on the face makes it so that it doesn''t work very well (the yellow and blue are interesting, though.) 5 for effort, but can''t do more than that. Sorry...</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I don''t think it quite works. To be nit-picky, it''s really not a rectangle, it''s more of a parallelogram (you don''t have 90 degree angles). The wild processing is close, but the red blotches on the face makes it so that it doesn''t work very well (the yellow and blue are interesting, though.) 5 for effort, but can''t do more than that. Sorry...', '2010-07-14 17:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6092991, 897377, 103142, '<td valign="top">It would have been better if you could have gotten up higher on this shot, so that you didn''t have a perspective problem. (it''s also tilted a little to the right) Unfortunately, since you have a grid for a background, it makes it more obvious than it otherwise would have been. 6</td>', 'It would have been better if you could have gotten up higher on this shot, so that you didn''t have a perspective problem. (it''s also tilted a little to the right) Unfortunately, since you have a grid for a background, it makes it more obvious than it otherwise would have been. 6', '2010-07-14 17:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
