(6093402, 897344, 102581, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the subject doesn''t really grab me.  No real wow factor for me.  Also, the top two rows of windows are reflecting light while the bottom two rows are pitch black.  That thows it off for me a little...</td>', 'I like the composition but the subject doesn''t really grab me.  No real wow factor for me.  Also, the top two rows of windows are reflecting light while the bottom two rows are pitch black.  That thows it off for me a little...', '2010-07-14 23:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
