(6093406, 897038, 102581, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and subject.  The shadows really throw the image off for me though.  Otherwise, I like it...</td>', 'I like the composition and subject.  The shadows really throw the image off for me though.  Otherwise, I like it...', '2010-07-14 23:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
