(6093737, 897623, 87252, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I like I saw a video recently where the same concept was used, dragging your furniture around as a metaphor for weight of responsibility. I really hope this does well.</td>', 'Great shot, I like I saw a video recently where the same concept was used, dragging your furniture around as a metaphor for weight of responsibility. I really hope this does well.', '2010-07-15 07:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
