(6093740, 897552, 87252, '<td valign="top">Torn paper perhaps? I like the texture and the colours, kind of reminds me of hiding in a cardboard box.</td>', 'Torn paper perhaps? I like the texture and the colours, kind of reminds me of hiding in a cardboard box.', '2010-07-15 07:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
