(6093748, 897517, 87252, '<td valign="top">Interesting clouds, good leading lines, not sure if the rectangles will be obvious enough not to get a lot of DNMC votes here.</td>', 'Interesting clouds, good leading lines, not sure if the rectangles will be obvious enough not to get a lot of DNMC votes here.', '2010-07-15 07:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
