(6095647, 896917, 10785, '<td valign="top">Fun find... How can this be made better??? Possibly use a bigger aperture to blur the background and remove the clutter, Portrait style framing might have helped eliminate some of the unnecessary background.</td>', 'Fun find... How can this be made better??? Possibly use a bigger aperture to blur the background and remove the clutter, Portrait style framing might have helped eliminate some of the unnecessary background.', '2010-07-17 12:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
