(6098933, 896781, 112739, '<td valign="top">Jenn you got a 9 from me on this! I loved it! Congrats on 5th! Me too in Spheres!</td>', 'Jenn you got a 9 from me on this! I loved it! Congrats on 5th! Me too in Spheres!', '2010-07-21 01:17:30.000000', NULL, 0),
