(6098970, 897514, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit I missed it, though I was not far off. I saw a square created by her legs and their reflection in the water. I''ll admit I didn''t care for the treatment you used on it. I did realize it was an intentional effect.</td>', 'I''ll admit I missed it, though I was not far off. I saw a square created by her legs and their reflection in the water. I''ll admit I didn''t care for the treatment you used on it. I did realize it was an intentional effect.', '2010-07-21 01:22:51.000000', NULL, 0),
