(6102020, 896976, 112828, '<td valign="top">From androgeus''s profile:<br/><i><b>Biography:  	...just wondering if it would be possible to break the 7.0 frontier with my Canon S3 IS?...<br/>I''ll do my best , anyway...</b></i> <br/> <br/>Wow, congrats man, looks like you''ve achieved your goal!  I admire you work very much, more-so for the choice of equipment.<br/> <br/>Well done, thanks for sharing!</td>', 'From androgeus''s profile:Biography:  	...just wondering if it would be possible to break the 7.0 frontier with my Canon S3 IS?...I''ll do my best , anyway...  Wow, congrats man, looks like you''ve achieved your goal!  I admire you work very much, more-so for the choice of equipment. Well done, thanks for sharing!', '2010-07-23 14:17:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6102332, 897283, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love this!<br/>As you know yourself, this photo has a number of technical flaws.<br/>However, I''m not sure if it would have the same make-you-smile charm if it was technically perfect.<br/>Lovely idea, and a big pat on the back to everyone for the effort.</td>', 'I love this!As you know yourself, this photo has a number of technical flaws.However, I''m not sure if it would have the same make-you-smile charm if it was technically perfect.Lovely idea, and a big pat on the back to everyone for the effort.', '2010-07-23 20:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6102416, 896976, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2010-07-23 22:29:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6102433, 896976, 94815, '<td valign="top">This is impressive especially to all us super DSLR users. I really enjoy the proof that with a less than pro camera, great results can be done. Good work.</td>', 'This is impressive especially to all us super DSLR users. I really enjoy the proof that with a less than pro camera, great results can be done. Good work.', '2010-07-23 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 0),
