(6102986, 897356, 117474, '<td valign="top">Was just checkin'' your profile out and saw the HM in rectangles and took a look. <br/> <br/>I gave this an 8. I thought the colour of the bricks was really interesting. The grid and the contrast of the blown our orange and the black was very interesting. <br/>The only... fault (and this is totally the wrong word) I saw in it when I voted was the tilt of the shot. It follows the break in the plaster on the top left, but it doesn''t follow the trends of the bricks This might be down to the shooting, though. You may have needed to be a few feet taller to get everything in parallel :) Need to add a cinder block to your shootin'' kit :P</td>', 'Was just checkin'' your profile out and saw the HM in rectangles and took a look.  I gave this an 8. I thought the colour of the bricks was really interesting. The grid and the contrast of the blown our orange and the black was very interesting. The only... fault (and this is totally the wrong word) I saw in it when I voted was the tilt of the shot. It follows the break in the plaster on the top left, but it doesn''t follow the trends of the bricks This might be down to the shooting, though. You may have needed to be a few feet taller to get everything in parallel :) Need to add a cinder block to your shootin'' kit :P', '2010-07-24 21:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
